a.constraint(3,'environment_admission_access',['stdo_environment','supplementary_representation'],'GTL declares required access; existing ABG owners admit exact bindings and access/context evidence before dependent work. Native material and explicitly selected supplements remain mandatory. Missing/ambiguous/mismatched/inaccessible/unpermitted inputs cause typed refusal/block before dispatch. Native access needs declared content, permissions and evidence but no unselected supplement. An a_c/access tool supplies only declared access/structural computation, not source authority, semantic application, work selection, grants or acceptance. Retrieval proves access, not correct application; valid evidence may be reused within scope/basis.')
